                <pb facs="0292" n="194" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg194"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-09-21"><hi rendition="#italic">September 21,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hill directs that Mr. Conger extend to Swedish and Norwegian missionaries
                    attached to American missions at Kweihua-Che’eng, or elsewhere in China, all
                    possible proper protection.)</p>
            </div>
